    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρρεπ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inclining the balance</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνᾶς -έστερον βραχύ</span> rather
				<i>more than</i> a mina <i>in weight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Damocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.919
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>leaning</i>
			<i>towards, prone to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.576f
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ φιλάνθρωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					6.9.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς κακίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					3p.425M.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστέρας τὰς γνώμας πρός τινα ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					5.8.2
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίδες -έστεραι</span>
			<i>favourable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.55.1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πῶς, ἔχειν πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.22.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τύχης ἐ. κινουμένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chor.
					<u>Milt.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.280
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span> Men.Prot.<i><span class="en">
				p.119
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
